WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were just talking
about Medicare,

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:04.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you actually needed
some medical attention yoursel

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.806 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
a few weeks ago.

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.675 line:92%
Tell me a little bit about that.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.644 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I was in Las Vegas.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:12.879 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We had an event,

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:17.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
and for the first time
in my life, I had to sit down.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was just feeling
very, very tired,

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I felt this pain
in my chest.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:25.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
Got back -- We left the even
and got in the car,

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:26.693 line:92%
and we knew something was wrong.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
We went to an urgent care plac
right near the hotel,

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they said,
"You're having a heart attack.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:34.567 size:75% position:38%
We got to a hospital
very, very quickly.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the care there was great
The doctors were great.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:40.907 line:92%
And I had two stents put in,

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:46.112
because it turned out that one
of my arteries was blocked up.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.180 line:92%
It was a procedure, I guess,

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
done about a million
times a year,

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:52.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was out of the hospita
in 2 1/2 days,

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.754 line:92%
and I've felt better ever since.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we've been back
on the campaign trail,

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:58.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
knock on wood...
-Yeah, absolutely.

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:01.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...full-time
for the last couple of weeks

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:02.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Are you --

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:06.299
In general, are you a pretty
healthy guy, or not really

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.200 line:92%
-That was what is amazing.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I -- Thank God,
I have been incredibly healthy

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I was a kid,
I was a long-distance runner

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.674 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I was a good athlete.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.376 size:78% position:39%
So when they told me
I had a heart attack,

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
I literally
could not believe it,

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:22.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
because, you know, I have ha
so much endurance

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:24.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
and strength throughout
my whole body.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.985 line:92%
But, you know, in retrospect

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
and maybe this is a messag
I want to convey,

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:30.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
listen to some of the symptoms
that were taking place.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.126 size:78% position:39%
I was getting tireder
than I usually was.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:33.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So...

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it stress?
Are we all too stressed out?

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.431 size:75% position:38%
I feel like you read
in the papers today,

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.833 line:92%
everyone is so stressed out.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
People who live in my building
are so stressed out.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everyone I run into
in the streets, stressed out

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:44.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We are stressed out.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:48.575
-People are, for a variety
of reason, political reasons

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:50.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
people are worried
about their kids.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are worried about
the environment.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:54.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are worried
about money.

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.983 line:92%
And yeah, we do live in --

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
People work
incredibly long hours.

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.387
I don't know if you know. We
work some of the longest hours

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.056 line:92%
of any people in the world

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:04.757 line:92%
So stress is a huge, huge issue.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did your wife say anythin
to you after the heart attack?

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:10.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did she say, "Hey, Bernie,
maybe let's rethink --"

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.198 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, she --

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:16.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was in Vermont,
and I was in Las Vegas.

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.570 line:92%
She didn't sleep all that night.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
She got onto the first plane
that she possibly could

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:24.210 size:78% position:39%
and got to Las Vegas
as soon as she could.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.814 size:84% position:42%
She has hardly left me
out of her sight since.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.517 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:31.985 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:32.652 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Well, I saw you --

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:34.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
You definitely came back
pretty quickly,

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:36.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
